# 14. Docker Compose — Ollama

Archivo:

```text
docker-ollama.yml
```

Contenido:

```yaml
services:
  ollama:
    image: ollama/ollama:latest
    container_name: ollama
    restart: unless-stopped

    ports:
      - "${OLLAMA_PORT}:11434"

    volumes:
      - "${PROJECT_DIR}/data/ollama:/root/.ollama"

    environment:
      - NVIDIA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=all
      - NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=compute,utility

    deploy:
      resources:
        reservations:
          devices:
            - driver: nvidia
              count: all
              capabilities:
                - gpu

    networks:
      - red-ia

networks:
  red-ia:
    external: true
```

Arrancar:

```bash
docker compose \
    --env-file .env \
    -f docker-ollama.yml \
    up -d
```

Comprobar:

```bash
docker ps
```

Probar API:

```bash
curl http://localhost:11434/api/tags
```

